%%{init: {"theme": "base", "themeVariables": {"background": "#dddddd", "primaryColor": "#ffffff", "primaryBorderColor": "#000000", "primaryTextColor": "#000000", "lineColor": "#000000", "textColor": "#000000", "actorBkg": "#ffffff", "actorBorder": "#000000", "actorTextColor": "#000000", "activationBkgColor": "#ffffff", "activationBorderColor": "#000000", "signalColor": "#000000", "signalTextColor": "#000000", "labelBoxBkgColor": "#ffffff", "labelBoxBorderColor": "#000000", "labelTextColor": "#000000", "sequenceNumberColor": "#000000", "noteBkgColor": "#ffffff", "noteBorderColor": "#000000", "noteTextColor": "#000000"}, "sequence": {"useMaxWidth": true, "wrap": true, "messageFontSize": 12, "noteFontSize": 12}}}%%
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor SA as Super Admin
    participant UI as Web UI
    participant C as AuditLogController
    participant ALog as AuditLog Model
    participant DB as Database

    SA->>UI: Buka menu Audit Log
    UI->>C: GET /admin/audit-logs
    %% note over C: Opsi: filter by user, action, resource, date range
    C->>ALog: Fetch audit logs dengan filter (jika ada)
    ALog->>DB: SELECT * FROM audit_logs WHERE ... ORDER BY created_at DESC LIMIT 100
    DB-->>ALog: List log entries dengan user, action, resource, timestamp, IP, changes
    ALog-->>C: Collection of audit logs
    C-->>UI: Response dengan paginated audit logs
    UI-->>SA: Tampilkan tabel: User | Action | Resource | Timestamp | Details
